WEBVTT

00:00:01.040 --> 00:00:10.820
Request from Ichigo... when watching the television, sit a safe distance from the television in a well-lit room.

00:00:06.320 --> 00:00:07.520
Heave, ho...

00:00:07.520 --> 00:00:10.500
Hurray! Hurray! Ichigo!

00:00:10.500 --> 00:00:11.890
Just a little further!

00:00:12.560 --> 00:00:15.240
Why do I have so much luggage?

00:00:15.240 --> 00:00:19.890
If you sent the luggage ahead of time, this wouldn't have happened.

00:00:19.890 --> 00:00:22.930
But you will get to see your family before you depart this way.

00:00:22.930 --> 00:00:24.290
Well, yeah, but...

00:00:26.500 --> 00:00:27.790
Finally home...

00:00:31.300 --> 00:00:33.260
Welcome home, Onee-chan!

00:00:33.660 --> 00:00:35.460
Welcome home, Ichigo.

00:00:35.460 --> 00:00:36.920
N-Natsume!

00:00:36.920 --> 00:00:38.470
What's with the party crackers?

00:00:38.470 --> 00:00:41.270
You got your long-cherished wish to go to Paris, right?

00:00:41.270 --> 00:00:43.480
So... Congratulations!

00:00:43.930 --> 00:00:45.800
Uh, well...

00:00:45.800 --> 00:00:48.120
It's not really something to celebrate exactly...

00:00:48.120 --> 00:00:50.150
In the end we lost the match, you see...

00:00:50.150 --> 00:00:54.660
That may be true, but you've gotten a second chance, right?

00:00:54.660 --> 00:00:56.060
You did really well.

00:00:56.060 --> 00:00:57.800
You're my daughter after all!

00:00:57.000 --> 00:00:58.500
OP sequence

00:00:57.800 --> 00:00:58.780
Mama...

00:00:59.200 --> 00:01:01.450
Anyway, come in!

00:01:01.920 --> 00:01:04.660
Papa, Onee-chan is back!

00:01:05.800 --> 00:01:07.430
I'm home, Papa.

00:01:07.430 --> 00:01:09.000
Oh, welcome back.

00:01:09.000 --> 00:01:12.510
Huh? What's wrong with Ichigo's dad?

00:01:15.450 --> 00:01:20.230
He's usually the person looking forward to Ichigo coming home the most.

00:01:20.860 --> 00:01:22.890
Hey, Papa... About this...

00:01:23.230 --> 00:01:24.390
Huh? What is it?

00:01:24.390 --> 00:01:27.980
They said I need my guardian's consent to go to Paris.

00:01:27.980 --> 00:01:28.750
So...

00:01:28.750 --> 00:01:31.070
Oh. I just need to sign it, right?

00:01:31.070 --> 00:01:33.440
Yup! Thanks a bunch.

00:01:34.850 --> 00:01:36.710
Her guardian's consent, huh?

00:01:39.250 --> 00:01:42.120
The atmosphere doesn't seem right here...

00:01:42.120 --> 00:01:43.260
I wonder why?

00:01:46.850 --> 00:01:53.120
fuwa fuwa funwari amakute toro kechau

00:01:46.850 --> 00:01:53.120
Fluffy, fluffy, fluffiness, so sweetly it melts.

00:01:53.120 --> 00:01:58.490
shiawase wo ageru yo yumeiro no pâtishièeru<i>!!</i>

00:01:53.120 --> 00:01:58.490
I'll give you happiness, the dream-coloured Pâtissière<i>!!</i>

00:01:58.510 --> 00:02:03.980
ichigo furejie & furanbowaazu, hapihapi makaron, hapinesu made go!

00:01:58.510 --> 00:02:03.980
Strawberry Fraisier & Framboise, happy happy Macaron, Happiness made go!

00:02:03.980 --> 00:02:09.160
chansu no tobira aketa toki kara kibun joujou ↑ ↑

00:02:03.980 --> 00:02:09.160
Since I opened the door of chance, my mood lifted.

00:02:09.160 --> 00:02:13.120
youkoso suiitsu no oukoku he

00:02:09.160 --> 00:02:13.120
Welcome to the Kingdom of Sweets.

00:02:13.140 --> 00:02:14.040
Bon appétit!

00:02:14.040 --> 00:02:21.410
hajimehane, hetappi demo megezu ni hibishoujin<i>!</i>

00:02:14.040 --> 00:02:21.410
Though I was terrible at the beginning, I was diligent everyday<i>!</i>

00:02:21.410 --> 00:02:24.050
「makeruna<i>! atashi」</i>

00:02:21.410 --> 00:02:24.050
「I won't lose<i>!</i> I said to myself」

00:02:24.220 --> 00:02:25.060
Courage!

00:02:26.260 --> 00:02:31.840
My dream migakeba hikaru takaramono

00:02:26.260 --> 00:02:31.840
My dream when polished is a shining treasure.

00:02:31.840 --> 00:02:34.560
fairy chikara kashite<i>!</i>

00:02:31.840 --> 00:02:34.560
Fairy, lend me your strength<i>!</i>

00:02:34.560 --> 00:02:39.970
shifon, se shibon, juré, bonjuuru, hatsuratsu furuutsu, raburii made go!

00:02:34.560 --> 00:02:39.970
Chiffon, C'est si bon, Gelée, Bonjour, Lively fruits, Lovely made go!

