Yumeiro Pâtissière is brought to you by Konami and these other sponsors.

00:03:21.400 --> 00:03:22.550
Beautiful!

00:03:28.210 --> 00:03:30.510
Let me sleep for a bit longer...

00:03:30.510 --> 00:03:33.270
Hey, Ichigo... You've got to wake up.

00:03:33.270 --> 00:03:35.800
Good morning, Onee-chan!

00:03:35.800 --> 00:03:37.160
Wake up already!

00:03:37.160 --> 00:03:40.990
We've got to pick up your passport and shop for your trip today!

00:03:42.550 --> 00:03:43.890
Whoa, you're so bouncy!

00:03:43.890 --> 00:03:45.270
Boing, boing!

00:03:45.560 --> 00:03:47.530
You've totally gotten fat...

00:03:47.980 --> 00:03:49.400
Natsume, why you...

00:03:49.400 --> 00:03:51.390
You ate way too many sweets!

00:03:51.390 --> 00:03:52.650
What did you say!?

00:03:52.650 --> 00:03:53.920
Hold it right there!

00:04:05.040 --> 00:04:06.170
Ichigo.

00:04:06.170 --> 00:04:08.170
S-Sorry, Onee-chan...

00:04:09.620 --> 00:04:12.140
Thanks to you, I'm totally awake now...

00:04:12.160 --> 00:04:18.130
recipe 39

00:04:12.160 --> 00:04:18.130
The Vanished Recipe

00:04:18.740 --> 00:04:21.830
Sheesh... What do you think you're doing so early?

00:04:21.830 --> 00:04:25.230
The two of you are going to get along today, got it?

00:04:25.230 --> 00:04:26.200
Okay...

00:04:26.950 --> 00:04:31.200
I don't know what I'd do if I couldn't see Ichigo for a long time...

00:04:32.450 --> 00:04:38.420
Fighting with Natsume, being scolded by Mama, falling down the stairs... It's all so nostalgic...

00:04:38.420 --> 00:04:40.920
I really feel like I've come home.

00:04:41.410 --> 00:04:43.680
I wonder how everyone else is doing?

00:04:43.950 --> 00:04:45.740
yu       me     tsuki

00:04:47.950 --> 00:04:51.460
Boiling down super sweet anko!

00:04:52.170 --> 00:04:53.230
Almost there...

00:04:53.230 --> 00:04:55.490
Sen-nii, switch with me!

00:04:56.030 --> 00:04:57.490
It's not finished yet.

00:04:57.490 --> 00:04:59.390
It's almost time for you to head to Paris, right?

00:04:59.390 --> 00:05:01.360
You should take it easy and rest.

00:05:01.760 --> 00:05:03.650
Thanks, Ichita.

00:05:03.650 --> 00:05:06.920
But it's precisely because it's almost time to leave that I wanted to do this.

00:05:06.920 --> 00:05:07.740
Why?

00:05:07.740 --> 00:05:11.700
When I head to Paris, I won't be able to help out here for a while.

00:05:11.700 --> 00:05:14.580
I might not even see any Japanese sweets.

00:05:14.580 --> 00:05:16.080
Sen-nii...

00:05:16.080 --> 00:05:20.200
So before I leave I want to experience my family's Japanese confections as much as I can.

00:05:20.200 --> 00:05:23.050
I'd like to polish my skills, if only a little.

00:05:23.350 --> 00:05:24.650
I see.

00:05:24.650 --> 00:05:27.580
If you'd go that far, then knock yourself out kiddo.

00:05:27.580 --> 00:05:30.460
Mixing kinako, making daifuku batter...

00:05:30.460 --> 00:05:32.690
You still have a lot to do, my boy.

00:05:32.690 --> 00:05:35.030
Why are you imitating grandpa?

00:05:40.020 --> 00:05:41.400
Satsuki...

00:05:41.400 --> 00:05:43.190
I've finished the watering over here.

00:05:43.190 --> 00:05:44.990
Thank you, Cafe-kun.

00:05:44.990 --> 00:05:47.810
The roses here are always so beautiful.

00:05:47.810 --> 00:05:51.500
I can tell they're cared for even more than the ones at the academy.

00:05:51.940 --> 00:05:53.200
Yes...

00:05:53.200 --> 00:06:00.490
These roses here were raised with great effort by my late father ever since I was a child.

00:06:00.490 --> 00:06:01.880
I see.

00:06:04.350 --> 00:06:06.900
What are you going to do with that rose?

00:06:06.900 --> 00:06:08.300
This? Well...

00:06:11.300 --> 00:06:12.810
I told you already!

00:06:13.250 --> 00:06:16.810
I just need my old man or mom to sign this!

00:06:16.810 --> 00:06:21.600
The Director and his wife will not see you until the medical examination is over.

00:06:21.600 --> 00:06:25.060
I apologise, but please leave, young master.

00:06:25.820 --> 00:06:28.000
Hey! What's the deal?

00:06:28.000 --> 00:06:29.030
Open up, damn it!

00:06:29.030 --> 00:06:32.550
My, my... Figured as much.

00:06:32.550 --> 00:06:37.040
It looks like your parents are against you going to Paris, Kashino.

00:06:37.040 --> 00:06:38.170
Damn it.

00:06:38.170 --> 00:06:40.960
Fine, I'll wait until the examination is over then.

00:06:42.960 --> 00:06:44.460
Amano-san!

00:06:42.980 --> 00:06:44.480
Travel Ticket Section (Passport)

00:06:44.460 --> 00:06:46.210
Amano Ichigo-san!

00:06:46.210 --> 00:06:47.970
Yes, that's me me me!

00:06:47.970 --> 00:06:50.970
Check it out! This is my passport!

00:06:51.310 --> 00:06:52.450
Nice, huh?

00:06:52.450 --> 00:06:53.760
Let's see...

00:06:53.760 --> 00:06:55.220
Definitely.

00:06:55.220 --> 00:06:55.970
What?

00:06:56.050 --> 00:06:57.980
You totally gained weight!

00:06:57.980 --> 00:06:59.900
What? N-No I didn't!

00:06:59.900 --> 00:07:02.240
That picture just makes me look fat!

00:07:02.240 --> 00:07:04.980
Quiet you two. Let's go.

00:07:07.180 --> 00:07:09.320
She even got a passport, huh...

00:07:09.740 --> 00:07:12.030
He's in a gloomy mood again today...

00:07:14.200 --> 00:07:15.850
Maybe this would be good?

00:07:16.200 --> 00:07:18.350
Or maybe this bigger one would...

00:07:18.350 --> 00:07:20.670
Don't get one too heavy for you to carry.

00:07:20.670 --> 00:07:21.710
Choose carefully.

00:07:22.800 --> 00:07:24.880
I think I could carry something this big, right?

00:07:26.570 --> 00:07:29.130
Sure, whatever you'd like.

00:07:30.280 --> 00:07:32.130
Ooh, over here! Over here!

00:07:32.130 --> 00:07:34.470
Here, here, bath towel spotted!

00:07:34.470 --> 00:07:37.790
Wait! I don't need one with some manga character on it.

00:07:37.790 --> 00:07:40.090
Dear, take that soap over there.

00:07:40.090 --> 00:07:40.730
Sure...

00:07:41.620 --> 00:07:45.230
Not detergent, I mean normal soap!

00:07:45.230 --> 00:07:47.160
Oh, sorry.

00:07:47.570 --> 00:07:49.010
How about this?

00:07:49.010 --> 00:07:49.570
Rejected.

00:07:50.240 --> 00:07:51.830
The Arc de Triomphe...

00:07:52.430 --> 00:07:53.900
The Eiffel Tower...

00:07:54.410 --> 00:07:56.280
The avenue des Champs-Élysées!

00:07:56.280 --> 00:07:57.750
Awesome...

00:07:57.750 --> 00:08:00.790
Really? I've seen them all on the TV.

00:08:00.790 --> 00:08:03.170
It's way more fun seeing them in person!

00:08:03.170 --> 00:08:05.960
Say Papa, which magazine will have the most information?

00:08:06.730 --> 00:08:08.400
You're going to study.

00:08:08.400 --> 00:08:09.800
You won't need something like this.

00:08:10.350 --> 00:08:12.010
Well yeah, but...

00:08:15.820 --> 00:08:17.850
Dear, come over here for a moment.

00:08:17.210 --> 00:08:17.850
What?

00:08:19.500 --> 00:08:20.350
What is it?

00:08:21.540 --> 00:08:23.590
I wanted to mention it earlier,

00:08:23.900 --> 00:08:29.240
but why have you been so gloomy ever since Ichigo came home yesterday?

00:08:29.240 --> 00:08:31.350
T-That's not true!

00:08:31.350 --> 00:08:34.800
My beloved daughter has come home... How could I be sad?

00:08:34.800 --> 00:08:39.910
Oh yeah? Then what was this I saw left on the table this morning.

00:08:41.910 --> 00:08:45.920
You still haven't signed the guardian's consent form, have you?

00:08:41.930 --> 00:08:43.540
Overseas Study Letter of Consent

00:08:44.150 --> 00:08:45.940
Guardian's Full Name

00:08:46.580 --> 00:08:50.960
I hope my intuition is wrong but are you against Ichigo going to Paris?

00:08:54.270 --> 00:08:55.470
Yes.

00:08:55.470 --> 00:08:58.830
Aw, shoot. I forgot my wallet.

00:08:58.830 --> 00:08:59.560
Mama?

00:09:02.060 --> 00:09:03.560
I am against it!

00:09:04.390 --> 00:09:07.730
I mean, Ichigo fell down the stairs this very morning!

00:09:07.730 --> 00:09:09.770
So what?

00:09:09.770 --> 00:09:14.120
She might fall down the stairs from the plane the second she gets to Paris!

00:09:17.650 --> 00:09:21.750
She'll get lost, then be saved by some slightly cute French guy...

00:09:22.230 --> 00:09:24.500
Then they'll get married just like that,

00:09:24.500 --> 00:09:27.020
and never come back to Japan again!

00:09:27.020 --> 00:09:29.430
That's not going to happen!

00:09:29.430 --> 00:09:32.460
She's only going for a number of weeks for the competition, remember?

00:09:32.460 --> 00:09:35.300
But if she wins, then it'll be two years abroad...

00:09:35.300 --> 00:09:36.280
Two years...

00:09:36.600 --> 00:09:40.180
A girl as clumsy as her living in Paris for two years?

00:09:40.180 --> 00:09:42.470
I'd never be able to stop worrying!

00:09:42.470 --> 00:09:43.820
Papa...

00:09:44.850 --> 00:09:47.430
So that's why he was so gloomy.

00:09:47.430 --> 00:09:49.700
Is your father always like that?

00:09:49.700 --> 00:09:50.550
Yeah...

00:09:50.550 --> 00:09:54.820
He was also against me going to St. Marie until the very end.

00:09:56.140 --> 00:09:58.350
So it's the same this time.

00:09:58.350 --> 00:09:59.370
What are you going to do?

00:09:59.370 --> 00:10:03.450
Going to Paris is my dream. I can't give up on it.

00:10:03.910 --> 00:10:08.960
But I can't just ignore my Papa's feelings, either...

00:10:08.960 --> 00:10:11.950
Anyway, I'll be keeping this.

00:10:11.950 --> 00:10:16.000
If you won't sign it, then I will.

00:10:16.520 --> 00:10:17.220
Kyouko..

00:10:21.990 --> 00:10:23.660
What should I do?

00:10:45.360 --> 00:10:46.260
Yo!

00:10:46.260 --> 00:10:47.620
It's Uncle Hikaru!

00:10:47.620 --> 00:10:53.710
After I heard you were going to Paris, I brought lots of sweets to celebrate.

00:10:53.710 --> 00:10:55.920
Thank you for coming all this way.

00:10:55.920 --> 00:10:58.380
Don't worry about it, eat up!

00:10:59.210 --> 00:11:00.090
Itadakimasu!

00:11:02.100 --> 00:11:04.950
What? You're just having one, Onee-chan?

00:11:04.950 --> 00:11:06.750
What happened to the cake eating champ?

00:11:06.750 --> 00:11:08.850
That's rare.

00:11:08.850 --> 00:11:11.980
Oh yeah, I found something interesting.

00:11:12.500 --> 00:11:13.400
Here.

00:11:13.980 --> 00:11:15.100
A video tape?

00:11:20.270 --> 00:11:21.410
What's this?

00:11:21.410 --> 00:11:26.270
Shigeru filmed it when you came over to play one time.

00:11:26.270 --> 00:11:29.070
Grandma! Grandma!

00:11:29.860 --> 00:11:31.990
What is it, Ichigo?

00:11:31.990 --> 00:11:34.630
It's back when grandma was feeling well...

00:11:34.630 --> 00:11:38.620
Grandma, what's your favourite sweet?

00:11:38.620 --> 00:11:45.170
Hmm... I put my heart into every
one I make, so I love them all.

00:11:45.920 --> 00:11:47.710
Then what about Papa?

00:11:47.710 --> 00:11:50.140
Your Papa's favourite is this.

00:11:50.720 --> 00:11:52.140
Doughnut holes.

00:11:55.260 --> 00:11:57.350
Yummy!

00:11:57.350 --> 00:11:59.420
That's right, doughnut holes!

00:11:59.420 --> 00:12:01.770
Maybe I should have some for old time's sake.

00:12:01.770 --> 00:12:03.160
Excuse me!

00:12:03.160 --> 00:12:04.700
Here, thanks for coming.

00:12:04.700 --> 00:12:05.600
Who's that?

00:12:05.600 --> 00:12:06.440
Dunno...

00:12:06.440 --> 00:12:07.270
Shiny!

00:12:07.750 --> 00:12:10.710
Hey, what're you guys looking at?

00:12:10.710 --> 00:12:12.710
J-Just kidding!

00:12:12.710 --> 00:12:14.290
Watch what happens next.

00:12:14.710 --> 00:12:17.970
Oh, too bad. They sold out.

00:12:17.970 --> 00:12:20.390
Then I'll try making them!

00:12:20.390 --> 00:12:21.800
Teach me how to make them!

00:12:21.800 --> 00:12:23.770
Well...

00:12:24.390 --> 00:12:25.680
Why not, then?

00:12:29.560 --> 00:12:31.180
Grandma's recipe book?

00:12:36.070 --> 00:12:40.570
I still haven't found the key to that recipe book.

00:12:41.530 --> 00:12:46.080
It doesn't seem like I'll be finding out the recipe for her strawberry tart for a while...

00:12:46.710 --> 00:12:48.120
I see...

00:12:48.120 --> 00:12:50.580
Shigeru, do you know anything about the key?

00:12:50.580 --> 00:12:51.590
I don't know.

00:12:53.500 --> 00:12:54.630
Ichigo!

00:12:56.720 --> 00:12:59.090
See? It's okay now.

00:12:59.430 --> 00:13:02.100
Oh, man... What was I doing?

00:13:02.100 --> 00:13:04.800
I guess you were a klutz even back then, Onee-chan.

00:13:05.640 --> 00:13:07.300
Papa's here with you.

00:13:07.300 --> 00:13:09.310
See? It doesn't hurt anymore.

00:13:11.980 --> 00:13:16.690
But to think that Ichigo is going to Paris to study making sweets...

00:13:16.690 --> 00:13:19.200
She sure has grown, hasn't she, Shigeru?

00:13:19.740 --> 00:13:21.160
I have some work to do.

00:13:21.160 --> 00:13:21.950
Later.

00:13:22.240 --> 00:13:27.250
What... Don't tell me you're against Ichigo going to Paris...

00:13:27.250 --> 00:13:28.870
You've got to let your children go, man!

00:13:29.870 --> 00:13:32.380
Oh, geez, he went and said it.

00:13:32.380 --> 00:13:33.870
He just put it so straightforwardly.

00:13:33.870 --> 00:13:36.130
That's not the case!

00:13:36.130 --> 00:13:40.550
I'm just worried about Ichigo. I'm not against it or anything...

00:13:40.550 --> 00:13:42.090
Wait, Papa!

00:13:42.090 --> 00:13:42.880
Ichigo?

00:13:43.430 --> 00:13:46.810
I have to get Papa to understand my feelings.

00:13:47.520 --> 00:13:49.180
Otherwise I can't go to Paris!

00:13:55.020 --> 00:13:58.520
Umm, I have something I want everyone to eat!

00:14:00.610 --> 00:14:03.820
That doughnut hole I ate of grandma's...

00:14:05.530 --> 00:14:07.870
I only remember it vaguely...

00:14:09.620 --> 00:14:13.210
But if I can do now what I couldn't do back then...

00:14:14.040 --> 00:14:17.000
I just know Papa will understand!

00:14:18.710 --> 00:14:20.290
Finished!

00:14:20.290 --> 00:14:23.470
Are these what we just saw on the video?

00:14:23.470 --> 00:14:25.760
These are grandma's doughnut holes.

00:14:25.760 --> 00:14:28.430
I think the recipe is pretty close, anyway.

00:14:28.430 --> 00:14:29.930
I wonder...

00:14:29.930 --> 00:14:31.600
Whatever, just try them already.

00:14:31.600 --> 00:14:33.310
Your daughter made you some sweets, right?

00:14:33.940 --> 00:14:36.310
Yeah... Itadakimasu.

00:14:39.440 --> 00:14:40.230
This is...

00:14:43.700 --> 00:14:48.450
Unlike my older brother, I didn't like things too sweet.

00:14:48.450 --> 00:14:51.750
So she made them less sweet just for me.

00:14:53.080 --> 00:14:56.290
It really is my mother's taste...

00:14:57.210 --> 00:14:58.170
Delicious...

00:14:58.170 --> 00:14:59.300
Really?

00:14:59.300 --> 00:15:01.340
Yeah, just the same as back then.

00:15:01.340 --> 00:15:03.010
It's my first time tasting this!

00:15:03.010 --> 00:15:04.670
Yes, delicious!

00:15:05.430 --> 00:15:11.680
Amazing... You only had one back then, and you can reproduce it now.

00:15:12.310 --> 00:15:15.850
See? I can actually do it now.

00:15:15.850 --> 00:15:18.900
So, I can handle going to Paris.

00:15:18.900 --> 00:15:20.940
I'm not your clumsy daughter anymore.

00:15:24.150 --> 00:15:28.070
Papa... I heard you were against it.

00:15:30.120 --> 00:15:35.830
But I enrolled in St. Marie, and fought together with my friends in the Grand Prix.

00:15:36.040 --> 00:15:39.410
Going to Paris has always been my goal.

00:15:39.920 --> 00:15:41.170
Ichigo.

00:15:41.960 --> 00:15:47.920
I want to study as hard as I can in Paris, and make sweets that make people smile!

00:15:48.600 --> 00:15:52.060
I want to become a wonderful pâtissière like grandma!

00:15:52.840 --> 00:15:56.350
That's my dream, and it's really important to me.

00:15:56.350 --> 00:16:00.730
I know I might make Papa, Mama and Natsume worried sometimes.

00:16:01.570 --> 00:16:03.780
But I want to go, no matter what.

00:16:04.150 --> 00:16:06.770
Please forgive your selfish daughter...

00:16:08.780 --> 00:16:13.540
You've grown up so much, and I never even realised it, Ichigo.

00:16:14.190 --> 00:16:15.370
Papa...

00:16:15.370 --> 00:16:20.590
It looks like you really have inherited your grandmother's talent.

00:16:23.170 --> 00:16:24.460
Come here for a bit.

00:16:27.090 --> 00:16:29.010
When you were born,

00:16:29.010 --> 00:16:31.220
Mama and I talked about it a lot.

00:16:31.800 --> 00:16:35.100
From Mama's perspective, you'd be a musician.

00:16:35.100 --> 00:16:37.810
And from mine you would grow up to be an artist.

00:16:39.060 --> 00:16:42.890
But you weren't any good at either of them.

00:16:43.570 --> 00:16:48.150
But now you've found your dream and are going to Paris.

00:16:49.490 --> 00:16:51.370
This is Paris!

00:16:51.370 --> 00:16:55.290
I also yearned for the city of art when I was young.

00:16:55.290 --> 00:16:56.910
I never went, though.

00:16:57.830 --> 00:17:01.290
To think it'd be my daughter who went first...

00:17:01.840 --> 00:17:03.080
Then...

00:17:03.630 --> 00:17:06.580
Yup! Do your best in Paris!

00:17:08.590 --> 00:17:10.590
Thank you, Papa!

00:17:10.590 --> 00:17:12.800
Onee-chan, I'll cheer you on!

00:17:13.560 --> 00:17:15.770
Let me say this, though!

00:17:15.770 --> 00:17:18.560
The Montmartre has a really long set of stairs!

00:17:18.560 --> 00:17:20.770
Do not fall down them, no matter what!

00:17:20.770 --> 00:17:24.310
And if some strange guy calls out to you, don't go with them!

00:17:24.310 --> 00:17:27.240
Looks like you didn't fix your worrywart attitude.

00:17:27.240 --> 00:17:30.410
If you keep worrying like that, your head'll be as shiny as mine!

00:17:33.200 --> 00:17:36.160
Ichigo's family is finally back to normal.

00:17:36.160 --> 00:17:39.700
I wonder how everyone else is doing?

00:17:39.720 --> 00:17:43.220
yu           me        tsuki

00:17:40.290 --> 00:17:43.200
Sen-nii! These are farewell gifts from us!

00:17:43.670 --> 00:17:46.710
Don't forget the Yumetsuki taste even in Paris!

00:17:46.710 --> 00:17:49.050
Ichita, everyone... For me...

00:17:50.970 --> 00:17:52.710
I'm so proud to be your brother!

00:17:56.430 --> 00:18:00.600
Mother, I will take this rose Father raised so well,

00:18:01.100 --> 00:18:04.720
and lay it at the place in Paris where he passed away.

00:18:08.730 --> 00:18:10.700
Not coming out, huh?

00:18:10.700 --> 00:18:12.320
In that case...

00:18:12.320 --> 00:18:14.410
Chocolat, you sign it.

00:18:14.910 --> 00:18:17.290
I can't do that!

00:18:19.830 --> 00:18:20.830
Nee-san?

00:18:25.790 --> 00:18:28.120
Ichigo, are you finished packing?

00:18:28.120 --> 00:18:29.090
Yup!

00:18:29.480 --> 00:18:30.760
This is the last.

00:18:30.760 --> 00:18:34.590
Maybe I'll send off your grandma's doughnut holes!

00:18:34.590 --> 00:18:35.960
Magical macaron.

00:18:35.960 --> 00:18:37.780
Sweets Romance Card.

00:18:37.780 --> 00:18:40.060
Come out!

00:18:43.350 --> 00:18:45.100
That'll be perfect!

00:18:48.140 --> 00:18:48.850
What's that?

00:18:48.850 --> 00:18:52.860
That's the same light as us Spirits!

00:18:56.950 --> 00:18:57.860
The spoon is...

00:18:59.910 --> 00:19:03.960
Oh yeah, this! I was going to say something but I forgot!

00:19:07.040 --> 00:19:11.010
It was next to your grandma's recipe book in the video!

00:19:12.550 --> 00:19:13.880
What does it mean?

00:19:13.880 --> 00:19:17.710
I don't know... But perhaps, this spoon is...

00:19:17.710 --> 00:19:19.350
The recipe book's...

00:19:19.890 --> 00:19:20.930
...key?

00:19:24.440 --> 00:19:25.430
It opened...

00:19:28.310 --> 00:19:30.190
Ichigo-chan is late, isn't she?

00:19:30.190 --> 00:19:32.070
Sorry!

00:19:32.070 --> 00:19:33.690
I'm late!

00:19:33.690 --> 00:19:36.660
What, did you oversleep on such an important day?

00:19:36.660 --> 00:19:37.870
Correct!

00:19:37.870 --> 00:19:40.570
She wouldn't wake up at all!

00:19:41.300 --> 00:19:42.700
A lot of stuff happened...

00:19:42.700 --> 00:19:46.200
Well, you made it in time, so it's not a problem.

00:19:46.200 --> 00:19:47.920
Finally...

00:19:47.920 --> 00:19:49.170
Yeah.

00:19:49.170 --> 00:19:53.010
There'll probably be some really incredible people waiting for us in Paris.

00:19:53.010 --> 00:19:54.710
We can't let our guard down one bit...

00:19:55.510 --> 00:19:57.970
And for me, that's not all.

00:20:00.350 --> 00:20:03.850
In the recipe book that I finally opened last night,

00:20:03.850 --> 00:20:07.720
the page with the strawberry tart was erased completely.

00:20:07.720 --> 00:20:12.780
If that spoon I got in the Kingdom of Sweets is my grandma's, then...

00:20:17.320 --> 00:20:20.240
Grandma had a Spirit, too?

00:20:37.010 --> 00:20:40.090
I'm on a journey to Paris now.

00:20:41.390 --> 00:20:44.340
If I go to Paris, will I solve this riddle, I wonder?

00:20:44.340 --> 00:20:47.810
Yes, I believe I will solve it!

00:21:15.050 --> 00:21:19.050
Grandma, please watch over me!

